This project builds on research and prior art from:

- DeskPad (MIT) — https://github.com/Stengo/DeskPad
  "A virtual monitor for screen sharing."
  CGVirtualDisplay usage pattern and click-to-warp cursor model.

- VirtualDisplayKit (MIT) — https://github.com/xocialize/VirtualDisplayKit
  SwiftPM wrapper for CGVirtualDisplay; moveCursor(to:) pattern.

- NotificationNanny — https://github.com/3rd-Musketeer/notification-nanny-focused-screen
  Symbol declarations for CGSSetWindowTransform / SLSSetWindowTransform,
  lifted with gratitude as the only documented cross-process transform attempt
  known to build on SIP-enabled macOS.

The SkyLight symbol inventory in this repo was derived by running
`dyld_info -exports` on macOS 26.6.2 (Tahoe, arm64) and does not include
any proprietary Apple material.
